<title>USA: Deposit Guaranty Q1 shr $0.54 vs $0.56.</title>
<headline>Deposit Guaranty Q1 shr $0.54 vs $0.56.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss. 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>DEPOSIT GUARANTY CORP.</p>
<p>							Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							     March 31,</p>
<p>							 1997	   1996</p>
<p>(Dollars in thousands except per share data)</p>
<p> Net income					 22,613	 21,489</p>
<p> Net income per share				.54	    .56</p>
<p>NOTE: The first quarter of 1996 included a gain of $1.7 million after income taxes, or $.05 per share, resulting from the disposition of assets related to lease financing transactions.</p>
<p>During the first quarter of 1997, Deposit Guaranty completed its acquisition of First Capital Bancorp Inc. This acquisition was accounted for as a pooling-of-interests transaction and is reflected in Deposit Guaranty's financial statements as of Jan. 1.</p>
</text>
